:: Credits
# Credits

## Warmth of Tribe
A Paleolithic survival journey created using the Twine Template (TwT).

### Game Design
- Character progression through life stages
- Skill development system
- Relationship mechanics
- Survival needs simulation
- Seasonal changes and environmental effects

### Artwork
- Primitive art-inspired UI design
- Natural, earthy color palette

